      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "SUBSTANTIAL FOUR-BEDROOM TOWN CENTRE RESIDENCE WITH LANDS TO THE REAR AND A RANGE OF OUTBUILDINGS, PROMINENTLY LOCATED ALONG MAIN STREET IN THE HEART OF KILLESHANDRA\n\nONLINE AUCTION 24th September 2026. Please refer to the advert on www.smithproperty.ie and click the Offr button to register your interest.\n\n\n(Unless Previously Sold)\n\nSmith Property welcome for sale by online auction this substantial four-bedroom residence, prominently positioned along Main Street Killeshandra, Co. Cavan. The property offers generous accommodation over two floors together with extensive lands extending to the rear and a range of traditional outbuildings.\n\nOccupying a convenient town centre position, the property is within walking distance of Killeshandra`s shops, schools, services, recreational amenities and community facilities. Cavan Town is also within convenient driving distance, making the property well positioned for access to the wider area.\n\nInternally, the residence provides spacious accommodation comprising four bedrooms together with the principal living accommodation, kitchen, utility areas and family bathroom. The dwelling is of an older style and would benefit from refurbishment and modernisation to bring it to a comfortable contemporary standard.\n\nA key feature of the property is the extensive lands extending to the rear, providing a substantial holding rarely available with a property in such a central Main Street location.\n\n A range of outbuildings and stores are also positioned to the rear, providing useful ancillary space.\n\nNotwithstanding its present condition, the property offers excellent potential for purchasers seeking a substantial renovation project. \n\nThe combination of the existing residence, extensive rear lands and central location may also offer further potential, subject to the necessary planning permission and statutory approvals.\n\nThis property is expected to appeal to a broad range of purchasers, including owner-occupiers, investors, builders and those seeking a refurbishment or potential development opportunity in the centre of Killeshandra.\n\nEarly viewing is recommended and strictly by appointment through the sole selling agents, Smith Property.\n\nPlease familiarise yourself with the auction process prior to bidding.\n\n\nPlease note the following:\n\n\nA 1,000 bidder security deposit, together with the applicable registration fee, must be paid in advance to enable bidding on the day of the auction. If unsuccessful, the 1,000 bidder security deposit will be fully refunded.\n\nIf you are the successful bidder, you will become immediately contracted upon the fall of the hammer, and the non-refundable balance of the 10% contract deposit must be paid immediately.\n\nInterested bidders must pre-register a minimum of 24 hours before the auction. Registration can be completed through the Offr widget on the property listing on our website.\n\nProspective bidders should also register to access the legal documents through their Offr account. Please note that all legal documents may not be available for download until closer to the auction date. Once registered, you will receive an alert when further documents become available.\n\nWe strongly recommend that all prospective purchasers arrange for their solicitor to review the legal documents before bidding.\n\nREGISTRATION DEADLINE: 3:00 p.m. on 23rd September 2026.\n\nNOTE: These particulars do not constitute a formal offer. They are provided for information purposes only and are intended to give a general description of the property. They shall not form any part of a resulting contract and should not be relied upon as statements or representations of fact.\n\nWhile every care has been taken in their preparation, neither Smith Property nor the vendor accepts any liability for their accuracy. Intending purchasers must satisfy themselves, by inspection or otherwise, as to the correctness of these particulars.\n\nNo person employed by Smith Property has authority to make or give any representation or warranty whatsoever in relation to this property."
